# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment variables
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# .env.production carries ONLY public client config (Appwrite endpoint + project
# id — the same values any visitor can read out of the shipped bundle). It must
# be committed or CI builds ship with the backend unset and /teach silently
# falls back to offline mode, which is exactly what happened on 2026-08-13.
# Secrets stay in /work/.secrets outside the repo, never in any .env here.
!.env.production

